th care professionals to plan, monitor, review, or evaluate the quality or effectiveness of drugs or drug regimens, providing advice on drug applications or characteristics.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:1816","label":"Compound and dispense medications as prescribed by doctors and dentists, by calculating, weighing, measuring, and mixing ingredients, or oversee these activities.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:1818","label":"Refer patients to other health professionals or agencies when appropriate.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:1819","label":"Prepare sterile solutions or infusions for use in surgical procedures, emergency rooms, or patients' homes.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:1820","label":"Plan, implement, or maintain procedures for mixing, packaging, or labeling pharmaceuticals, according to policy and legal requirements, to ensure quality, security, and proper disposal.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:1821","label":"Assay radiopharmaceuticals, verify rates of disintegration, and calculate the volume required to produce the desired results, to ensure proper dosages.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:1822","label":"Manage pharmacy operations, hiring or supervising staff, performing administrative duties, or buying or selling non-pharmaceutical merchandise.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:1823","label":"Work in hospitals or clinics or for Health Management Organizations (HMOs), dispensing prescriptions, serving as a medical team consultant, or specializing in specific drug therapy areas, such as oncology or nuclear pharmacotherapy.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:1824","label":"Assess the identity, strength, or purity of medications.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src"